Package: midphysac
Title: Midlife Physical Activity as Predictor of Later-life Cognition
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Josef",
        family = "Mana",
        email = "josef.mana@protonmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7817-3978"))
Description: Using data collected during the COSACTIW retrospective
    cross-sectional study and its add-on sample, KOKOSA, estimates cognitive,
    and self-reported affective, functional independence and epidemiological
    differences stratified by old-old women's attitudes toward physical activity
    (A2PA). It also provides infrastructure for variable selection of SuperAging
    predictors in this cohort.
